# First Horde raptor from Zjolnir (Sen'jin Village).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: the client files every racial riding spell under one Riding
# skill (SkillLineAbility), so any riding trainer of your faction teaches it:
# Apprentice Riding (skill 75) from level 40, Journeyman Riding (150) at 60.
# Blizzard: learning to ride grants a mount, and training costs 100g at 40 and
# 1,000g at 60 (Kris Zierhut). ItemSparse lists the
# mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60), usable by every race of the
# faction; whether a vendor still wants Exalted with another race's city (the
# Era rule) is server-side and unconfirmed.

step Learn to ride
  zone Durotar
  tip Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 40 Xar'Ti teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these.
  level 40
  train 7953                          -- Xar'Ti, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Pick a colour
  tip Zjolnir sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 7952                         -- Zjolnir
  buy 8588 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Emerald Raptor, 20g
  buy 8591 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Turquoise Raptor, 20g
  buy 8592 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Violet Raptor, 20g
